[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
ser2netweb runs as the user ser2netweb (a member of the dialer group, which
may open the serial ports /dev/cua*) with its data in /var/db/ser2netweb:

  sysrc ser2netweb_enable=YES
  service ser2netweb start

The web UI then listens on 127.0.0.1:8080. To put it elsewhere:

  sysrc ser2netweb_env="SER2NETWEB_BIND_IP=0.0.0.0 SER2NETWEB_PORT=8080"

Set the first admin password in the browser, or as the service user:

  su -m ser2netweb -c '%%PREFIX%%/bin/ser2netweb --data-dir /var/db/ser2netweb --set-password admin'
EOM
}
]
